  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="33">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 33</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="33"><pb n="254" ed="#liebermann"/>[Not in D]</ab>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="ang" source="#liebermann" n="33" corresp="#wit-k"><pb n="254" ed="#liebermann"/>K. ⁊ wærlic bið, þ<hi rend="italic">æt</hi> man æghwilce geare sona æfter eastron fyrdscipa gearwige.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="33" corresp="#wit-k"><ptr type="editorNote" n="8" target="#VIAtr_33.robnote.fn.8"/><pb n="100" ed="#robertson"/>⁊ wærlic bið þæt man æghwilce geare sona æfter eastron fyrdscipa gearwige.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k"><pb n="172" ed="#rabin-doml"/>And wærlic bið þæt man æghwilce geare sona æfter Eastron fyrdscipa gearwige.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann"><pb n="255" ed="#liebermann"/>Und vorsichtig ist, dass in jedem Jahre die Schiffe der Seewehr bald nach Ostern hergerichtet werden.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And it is prudent that the ships of the naval force be made ready every year soon after Easter.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k"><ptr type="editorNote" n="1" target="#VIAtr_33.robnote.n.1"/><pb n="101" ed="#robertson"/>And it is a wise precaution to have warships made ready every year soon after Easter.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-k"><pb n="173" ed="#rabin-doml"/>And it is prudent to have the warships prepared each year just after Easter.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="255"><ref target="clause:VAtr_27">V Atr 27</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">ebd. 27</note>
        <note type="editorial">Only in K. Liebermann compares V Atr 27.</note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="endnote" xml:id="VIAtr_33.robnote.n.1" n="1" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">334</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="en">Cf. V, 27.</seg></note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="footnote" xml:id="VIAtr_33.robnote.fn.8" n="8" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">100</biblScope></bibl><label>⁊</label><seg type="original" xml:lang="en">Caps. 33–39 (end) om. D.</seg></note>
      </div>
